    "name": "Lunar Siege",
    "steam_appid": 2295980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295980/extras/e58a603431290b71c023b7a569c5d0aa.avif?t=1752152503\" /></span><br>Waves of Enemy ships are attacking Earths <strong>Moon Bases</strong>, and <i>only you can stop them</i>!<br><br>Make your way across the lunar surface on <strong>8 challenging Courses</strong>, with increasing numbers of Stations to rescue (5 - 11 Stations).<br><br>Avoid natural hazards such as <strong>Craters</strong> and <strong>Rocks</strong> blocking your path, as well as 'random' <strong>Meteor Showers</strong>.<br><br>Enemy ships have also broken off from the main attack force and are trying to prevent your arrival.<br><br>Along your journey collect <strong>Energy</strong> to refuel the <strong>Station</strong>, and special <strong>Tech</strong> and Bonus items to assist you.<br><br>Defeat the <strong>Mothership</strong> at the end of each Course <i>to unlock the next one</i>.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295980/extras/e58a603431290b71c023b7a569c5d0aa.avif?t=1752152503\" /></span><br>Waves of Enemy ships are attacking Earths <strong>Moon Bases</strong>, and <i>only you can stop them</i>!<br><br>Make your way across the lunar surface on <strong>8 challenging Courses</strong>, with increasing numbers of Stations to rescue (5 - 11 Stations).<br><br>Avoid natural hazards such as <strong>Craters</strong> and <strong>Rocks</strong> blocking your path, as well as 'random' <strong>Meteor Showers</strong>.<br><br>Enemy ships have also broken off from the main attack force and are trying to prevent your arrival.<br><br>Along your journey collect <strong>Energy</strong> to refuel the <strong>Station</strong>, and special <strong>Tech</strong> and Bonus items to assist you.<br><br>Defeat the <strong>Mothership</strong> at the end of each Course <i>to unlock the next one</i>.",
    "short_description": "8 challenging Courses. Avoid hazards such as Craters, Rocks, and Meteor Showers. Enemy ships are also trying to prevent your arrival at the Station. Collect Energy to refuel the Station, and special Tech and Bonus items. Defeat the Mothership at the end of each Course to unlock the next one.",
